<?xml version='1.0' encoding='utf-8'?>
<bpmn:definitions xmlns:bioc="http://bpmn.io/schema/bpmn/biocolor/1.0" xmlns:bpmn="http://www.omg.org/spec/BPMN/20100524/MODEL" xmlns:bpmndi="http://www.omg.org/spec/BPMN/20100524/DI" xmlns:dc="http://www.omg.org/spec/DD/20100524/DC" xmlns:di="http://www.omg.org/spec/DD/20100524/DI" id="Definitions_fluxbank-transfer-entry-detail" targetNamespace="https://fluxbank.local/architecture" exporter="FluxBank architecture documentation" exporterVersion="2">
  <bpmn:process id="fluxbank-transfer-entry-detail_client" name="Client" isExecutable="false">
    <bpmn:serviceTask id="fluxbank-transfer-entry-detail_serviceTask1" name="Submit transfer&#10;POST /api/v1/transfers&#10;Bearer JWT; amount = 100 EUR" />
  </bpmn:process>
  <bpmn:process id="fluxbank-transfer-entry-detail_app" name="FluxBank | entry and ownership checks" isExecutable="false">
    <bpmn:laneSet id="fluxbank-transfer-entry-detail_app_lanes">
      <bpmn:lane id="fluxbank-transfer-entry-detail_app_sec" name="Security">
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>fluxbank-transfer-entry-detail_serviceTask2</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>fluxbank-transfer-entry-detail_serviceTask3</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
      </bpmn:lane>
      <bpmn:lane id="fluxbank-transfer-entry-detail_app_valid" name="Validation">
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>fluxbank-transfer-entry-detail_serviceTask6</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>fluxbank-transfer-entry-detail_serviceTask7</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>fluxbank-transfer-entry-detail_serviceTask8</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
      </bpmn:lane>
      <bpmn:lane id="fluxbank-transfer-entry-detail_app_route" name="Routing">
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>fluxbank-transfer-entry-detail_serviceTask12</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>fluxbank-transfer-entry-detail_exclusiveGateway14</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>fluxbank-transfer-entry-detail_serviceTask16</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>fluxbank-transfer-entry-detail_serviceTask17</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
      </bpmn:lane>
    </bpmn:laneSet>
    <bpmn:serviceTask id="fluxbank-transfer-entry-detail_serviceTask2" name="01 | Require authentication&#10;SecurityConfig.securityFilterChain()">
      <bpmn:documentation>Stateless; CSRF disabled; login/register public, all other requests authenticated. No extra transfer role rule.
Sources: SecurityConfig.securityFilterChain() — src/main/java/com/fluxbank/common/security/SecurityConfig.java:27</bpmn:documentation>
      <bpmn:outgoing>fluxbank-transfer-entry-detail_Flow5</bpmn:outgoing>
    </bpmn:serviceTask>
    <bpmn:serviceTask id="fluxbank-transfer-entry-detail_serviceTask3" name="02 | Verify JWT and user&#10;JwtAuthenticationFilter&#10;.doFilterInternal()">
      <bpmn:documentation>Bearer token → JwtService.extractUsername() validates signature/expiration → CustomUserDetailsService.loadUserByUsername(). Disabled user or invalid JWT: 401.
Sources: JwtAuthenticationFilter.doFilterInternal() — src/main/java/com/fluxbank/common/security/JwtAuthenticationFilter.java:30; JwtService.extractUsername() — src/main/java/com/fluxbank/common/security/JwtService.java:59; CustomUserDetailsService.loadUserByUsername() — src/main/java/com/fluxbank/common/security/CustomUserDetailsService.java:21</bpmn:documentation>
      <bpmn:incoming>fluxbank-transfer-entry-detail_Flow5</bpmn:incoming>
      <bpmn:outgoing>fluxbank-transfer-entry-detail_Flow9</bpmn:outgoing>
    </bpmn:serviceTask>
    <bpmn:sequenceFlow id="fluxbank-transfer-entry-detail_Flow5" sourceRef="fluxbank-transfer-entry-detail_serviceTask2" targetRef="fluxbank-transfer-entry-detail_serviceTask3" />
    <bpmn:serviceTask id="fluxbank-transfer-entry-detail_serviceTask6" name="03 | Validate request&#10;TransferController.createTransfer()&#10;@Valid CreateTransferRequest">
      <bpmn:documentation>UUIDs required; amount @NotNull @Positive @Digits(integer=17,fraction=2). Invalid DTO: 400. No currency/type field.
Sources: TransferController.createTransfer() — src/main/java/com/fluxbank/transfer/api/TransferController.java:21; CreateTransferRequest — src/main/java/com/fluxbank/transfer/api/CreateTransferRequest.java:10</bpmn:documentation>
      <bpmn:incoming>fluxbank-transfer-entry-detail_Flow9</bpmn:incoming>
      <bpmn:outgoing>fluxbank-transfer-entry-detail_Flow10</bpmn:outgoing>
    </bpmn:serviceTask>
    <bpmn:serviceTask id="fluxbank-transfer-entry-detail_serviceTask7" name="04 | Resolve owner&#10;TransferService.createTransfer()&#10;UserRepository.findByEmail()">
      <bpmn:documentation>Sources: TransferService.createTransfer() — src/main/java/com/fluxbank/transfer/application/TransferService.java:59; UserRepository.findByEmail() — src/main/java/com/fluxbank/customer/repository/UserRepository.java:16</bpmn:documentation>
      <bpmn:incoming>fluxbank-transfer-entry-detail_Flow10</bpmn:incoming>
      <bpmn:outgoing>fluxbank-transfer-entry-detail_Flow11</bpmn:outgoing>
    </bpmn:serviceTask>
    <bpmn:serviceTask id="fluxbank-transfer-entry-detail_serviceTask8" name="05 | Check account + beneficiary&#10;Owner-scoped repository lookups">
      <bpmn:documentation>TransferService invokes AccountRepository.findByPublicIdAndUser(), then BeneficiaryRepository.findByPublicIdAndOwnerAndActiveTrue(). Missing/wrong owner/inactive beneficiary: 404. Recipient may belong to another user.
Sources: AccountRepository.findByPublicIdAndUser() — src/main/java/com/fluxbank/account/repository/AccountRepository.java:46; BeneficiaryRepository.findByPublicIdAndOwnerAndActiveTrue() — src/main/java/com/fluxbank/beneficiary/repository/BeneficiaryRepository.java:23</bpmn:documentation>
      <bpmn:incoming>fluxbank-transfer-entry-detail_Flow11</bpmn:incoming>
      <bpmn:outgoing>fluxbank-transfer-entry-detail_Flow13</bpmn:outgoing>
    </bpmn:serviceTask>
    <bpmn:sequenceFlow id="fluxbank-transfer-entry-detail_Flow9" sourceRef="fluxbank-transfer-entry-detail_serviceTask3" targetRef="fluxbank-transfer-entry-detail_serviceTask6" />
    <bpmn:sequenceFlow id="fluxbank-transfer-entry-detail_Flow10" sourceRef="fluxbank-transfer-entry-detail_serviceTask6" targetRef="fluxbank-transfer-entry-detail_serviceTask7" />
    <bpmn:sequenceFlow id="fluxbank-transfer-entry-detail_Flow11" sourceRef="fluxbank-transfer-entry-detail_serviceTask7" targetRef="fluxbank-transfer-entry-detail_serviceTask8" />
    <bpmn:serviceTask id="fluxbank-transfer-entry-detail_serviceTask12" name="06 | Resolve beneficiary IBAN&#10;AccountRepository.findByIban()">
      <bpmn:documentation>Uses stored active beneficiary. No repeated IBAN checksum validation here. TransferService has no @Transactional.
Sources: AccountRepository.findByIban() — src/main/java/com/fluxbank/account/repository/AccountRepository.java:51</bpmn:documentation>
      <bpmn:incoming>fluxbank-transfer-entry-detail_Flow13</bpmn:incoming>
      <bpmn:outgoing>fluxbank-transfer-entry-detail_Flow15</bpmn:outgoing>
    </bpmn:serviceTask>
    <bpmn:sequenceFlow id="fluxbank-transfer-entry-detail_Flow13" sourceRef="fluxbank-transfer-entry-detail_serviceTask8" targetRef="fluxbank-transfer-entry-detail_serviceTask12" />
    <bpmn:exclusiveGateway id="fluxbank-transfer-entry-detail_exclusiveGateway14" name="Local account exists?">
      <bpmn:incoming>fluxbank-transfer-entry-detail_Flow15</bpmn:incoming>
      <bpmn:outgoing>fluxbank-transfer-entry-detail_Flow18</bpmn:outgoing>
      <bpmn:outgoing>fluxbank-transfer-entry-detail_Flow19</bpmn:outgoing>
    </bpmn:exclusiveGateway>
    <bpmn:sequenceFlow id="fluxbank-transfer-entry-detail_Flow15" sourceRef="fluxbank-transfer-entry-detail_serviceTask12" targetRef="fluxbank-transfer-entry-detail_exclusiveGateway14" />
    <bpmn:serviceTask id="fluxbank-transfer-entry-detail_serviceTask16" name="INTERNAL | reject A = B&#10;TransferService&#10;.processInternalTransfer()">
      <bpmn:documentation>SameAccountTransferException before PENDING creation. Then see fluxbank-internal-transfer-detail.bpmn.
Sources: TransferService.processInternalTransfer() — src/main/java/com/fluxbank/transfer/application/TransferService.java:104</bpmn:documentation>
      <bpmn:incoming>fluxbank-transfer-entry-detail_Flow18</bpmn:incoming>
    </bpmn:serviceTask>
    <bpmn:serviceTask id="fluxbank-transfer-entry-detail_serviceTask17" name="EXTERNAL | reserve first&#10;TransferService&#10;.processExternalTransfer()">
      <bpmn:documentation>See fluxbank-external-transfer-detail.bpmn. Repeating POST is not protected by request idempotency.
Sources: TransferService.processExternalTransfer() — src/main/java/com/fluxbank/transfer/application/TransferService.java:169</bpmn:documentation>
      <bpmn:incoming>fluxbank-transfer-entry-detail_Flow19</bpmn:incoming>
    </bpmn:serviceTask>
    <bpmn:sequenceFlow id="fluxbank-transfer-entry-detail_Flow18" sourceRef="fluxbank-transfer-entry-detail_exclusiveGateway14" targetRef="fluxbank-transfer-entry-detail_serviceTask16" name="Yes" />
    <bpmn:sequenceFlow id="fluxbank-transfer-entry-detail_Flow19" sourceRef="fluxbank-transfer-entry-detail_exclusiveGateway14" targetRef="fluxbank-transfer-entry-detail_serviceTask17" name="No" />
  </bpmn:process>
  <bpmn:collaboration id="Collaboration_fluxbank-transfer-entry-detail">
    <bpmn:documentation>02 | HTTP security, validation and routing
Source: current working tree, 2026-11-08. Documentation only; isExecutable=false. Solid arrows = local execution order. Dashed arrows = HTTP/Kafka messages across pools. Green expanded subprocess = Spring database transaction, not BPMN compensation semantics. Red = failure; amber = retry/recovery. DB visibility is by commit and SELECT, not an in-memory message. Open README.md for the source index and linked pages.</bpmn:documentation>
    <bpmn:participant id="fluxbank-transfer-entry-detail_client_pool" name="Client" processRef="fluxbank-transfer-entry-detail_client" />
    <bpmn:participant id="fluxbank-transfer-entry-detail_app_pool" name="FluxBank | entry and ownership checks" processRef="fluxbank-transfer-entry-detail_app" />
    <bpmn:messageFlow id="fluxbank-transfer-entry-detail_Message4" sourceRef="fluxbank-transfer-entry-detail_serviceTask1" targetRef="fluxbank-transfer-entry-detail_serviceTask2" name="HTTP request" />
  </bpmn:collaboration>
